The ball's bounding box is `[ball.x - ball.r, ball.x + ball.r]` and `[ball.y - ball.r, ball.y + ball.r]`.
The brick's bounding box is `[brick.x, brick.x + brick.w]` and `[brick.y, brick.y + brick.h]`.

